                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="all animals killed on the hunt, the Reindeer Chukchee set the highest value"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l5" HPOS="428" VPOS="701" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="428 730 2201 730" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 730 428 746 2201 746 2201 730 2201 701 428 701 428 730"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="on wild reindeer-bucks killed in the herd during the rutting-season, because"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l6" HPOS="426" VPOS="748" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="428 791 2199 787" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 791 428 804 2197 802 2199 787 2197 757 2179 748 2177 748 2175 748 2173 748 1609 757 1576 748 1574 748 1572 748 1519 757 1492 748 1490 748 1488 748 1486 748 1447 757 1382 748 1380 748 1378 748 1335 757 1255 750 1253 750 1251 750 1249 750 1235 759 1169 750 1167 750 1108 759 842 750 840 750 795 759 761 750 759 750 757 750 697 759 658 750 656 750 654 750 540 759 450 750 448 750 446 750 444 750 426 757 428 791"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="their coming is thought to affect favorably the fortune of the herd.¹ With"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l7" HPOS="428" VPOS="810" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="428 849 2199 849" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 849 428 865 2199 865 2199 849 2199 820 2158 810 2156 810 2154 810 2152 810 2117 820 2076 810 2074 810 2072 810 2070 810 2036 820 1970 810 1968 810 1878 820 1549 810 1547 810 1545 810 1523 822 1369 822 1353 810 1351 810 1349 810 1204 810 1202 810 1200 810 1179 822 1018 822 967 810 965 810 963 810 961 810 947 820 895 810 893 810 891 810 889 810 875 820 842 810 840 810 838 810 775 820 740 810 738 810 736 810 644 820 540 810 538 810 536 810 503 820 452 810 450 810 448 810 428 820 428 849"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the killing of such bucks a complicated ceremonial — performed late in the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l8" HPOS="426" VPOS="867" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="428 908 2199 904" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 908 428 924 2197 922 2199 904 2193 871 1376 877 1345 867 1343 867 1341 867 1339 867 1308 881 1116 881 1085 869 1083 869 1081 869 1079 869 1077 869 1061 881 875 881 834 869 832 869 830 869 732 879 677 869 675 869 673 869 644 879 573 869 571 869 520 879 440 869 438 869 436 869 434 869 426 875 428 908"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="fall, after the rutting-season is over — is connected. The Chukchee contend"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l9" HPOS="426" VPOS="926" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="428 971 2195 965" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 971 428 985 2191 988 2195 965 2191 938 1786 926 1784 926 1782 926 1754 936 1725 926 1723 926 1721 926 1590 938 1077 928 1075 928 1010 940 567 930 566 930 564 930 526 940 446 930 444 930 442 930 440 930 426 938 428 971"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="that these animals are not hunted down by the personal skill of the hunter,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l10" HPOS="428" VPOS="987" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="430 1032 2197 1026" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1032 430 1045 2193 1049 2197 1026 2195 996 2177 987 2175 987 2173 987 2172 987 2170 987 2132 996 2093 987 2091 987 2089 987 2087 987 2062 996 2015 987 2013 987 1925 998 1799 998 1778 987 1776 987 1774 987 1660 996 1633 987 1631 987 1629 987 1627 987 1604 998 1549 988 1547 988 1545 988 1519 998 1498 988 1496 988 1494 988 1492 988 1464 1000 1253 1000 1237 988 1235 988 1233 988 1231 988 1173 998 1145 988 1143 988 1141 988 1032 998 893 990 891 990 889 990 887 990 871 1000 428 996 430 1032"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="but that they are lured within his easy reach by the influence of the herd,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l11" HPOS="426" VPOS="1047" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="428 1090 2199 1086" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1090 428 1104 2197 1102 2199 1086 2195 1059 2146 1047 2144 1047 2142 1047 2103 1057 1447 1047 1445 1047 1443 1047 1441 1047 1425 1059 1263 1059 450 1049 448 1049 446 1049 444 1049 426 1057 428 1090"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="therefore it is only fitting that a return should be made in the form of a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l12" HPOS="426" VPOS="1106" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="428 1151 2199 1145" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1151 428 1167 2197 1161 2199 1145 2195 1118 1866 1106 1864 1106 1862 1106 1835 1116 1805 1106 1803 1106 1801 1106 1799 1106 1762 1116 1731 1106 1729 1106 1727 1106 1652 1116 1625 1106 1623 1106 1621 1106 1619 1106 1617 1106 1602 1118 1543 1108 1541 1108 1539 1108 1515 1118 1302 1108 1300 1108 1298 1108 1296 1108 1280 1120 1151 1120 1075 1108 1073 1108 1014 1120 611 1110 609 1110 426 1122 428 1151"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ceremonial and sacrifice; while, on the other hand, animals killed far from"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l13" HPOS="430" VPOS="1176" WIDTH="978" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="430 1210 1408 1210" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1210 430 1225 1408 1225 1408 1210 1408 1182 430 1176 430 1210"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="home and herd require no such ceremony."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l14" HPOS="536" VPOS="1227" WIDTH="1663" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="538 1270 2199 1267" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="538 1270 538 1284 2197 1280 2199 1267 2195 1237 1398 1227 1396 1227 1394 1227 1363 1239 536 1239 538 1270"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Since the ceremonial connected with the hunt of walrus and larger kinds"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l15" HPOS="426" VPOS="1286" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="428 1331 2199 1325" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1331 428 1347 2197 1341 2199 1325 2197 1298 2173 1286 2172 1286 2170 1286 2123 1296 2079 1286 2077 1286 2076 1286 2074 1286 2046 1296 1913 1286 1911 1286 1909 1286 1870 1296 1797 1286 1795 1286 1641 1296 1611 1286 1609 1286 1607 1286 1605 1286 1558 1298 1525 1288 1523 1288 1521 1288 1470 1300 1128 1300 1075 1288 1073 1288 989 1300 955 1290 953 1290 951 1290 949 1290 912 1300 891 1290 889 1290 887 1290 834 1300 742 1290 740 1290 650 1300 630 1290 628 1290 464 1290 462 1290 460 1290 426 1300 428 1331"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of seal is performed about the same season and with somewhat similar details"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l16" HPOS="428" VPOS="1345" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="430 1390 2199 1384" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1390 430 1406 2197 1400 2199 1384 2195 1357 2134 1345 2132 1345 2130 1345 2103 1355 2025 1345 2023 1345 1964 1357 1823 1357 1805 1345 1803 1345 1801 1345 1799 1345 1797 1345 1774 1355 1750 1345 1748 1345 1747 1345 1745 1345 1723 1355 1545 1347 1543 1347 1541 1347 1539 1347 1525 1357 1500 1347 1498 1347 1496 1347 1494 1347 1468 1357 1447 1347 1445 1347 1443 1347 1441 1347 1417 1357 1404 1347 1402 1347 1400 1347 1398 1347 1396 1347 1372 1357 1314 1347 1312 1347 1210 1357 1102 1347 1100 1347 1098 1347 1067 1357 1053 1347 1051 1347 1049 1347 1047 1347 1045 1347 1014 1357 961 1349 959 1349 957 1349 955 1349 942 1359 861 1349 859 1349 802 1359 781 1349 779 1349 777 1349 712 1359 671 1349 669 1349 667 1349 665 1349 630 1359 603 1349 601 1349 599 1349 428 1353 430 1390"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="by both the Maritime Chukchee and the Asiatic Eskimo, it is my opinion that"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l17" HPOS="426" VPOS="1408" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="428 1449 2199 1445" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1449 428 1464 2197 1460 2199 1445 2195 1417 1323 1408 1322 1408 1320 1408 1318 1408 1300 1417 446 1410 444 1410 442 1410 440 1410 426 1415 428 1449"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the purpose of this ceremonial is to celebrate success on the hunt. I believe"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l18" HPOS="426" VPOS="1472" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="428 1511 2201 1505" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1511 428 1525 2183 1529 2185 1529 2187 1529 2189 1529 2201 1519 2201 1505 2197 1484 1923 1484 1897 1472 1880 1484 1725 1484 1700 1472 1666 1484 1639 1472 1607 1486 1568 1474 1543 1486 1515 1474 1474 1486 1433 1474 1394 1486 1359 1474 1333 1486 1284 1474 1133 1474 1116 1486 987 1476 969 1488 930 1476 898 1488 863 1476 787 1488 761 1476 426 1482 428 1511"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="it is connected with the bucks killed in the herd simply because they represent"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l19" HPOS="430" VPOS="1527" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="432 1570 2197 1566" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1570 432 1584 2195 1582 2197 1566 2195 1539 2154 1527 2152 1527 2150 1527 2148 1527 2115 1537 1985 1527 1983 1527 1935 1537 1907 1527 1905 1527 1903 1527 1803 1537 1778 1527 1776 1527 1774 1527 1772 1527 1770 1527 1754 1539 1447 1539 1398 1527 1396 1527 1310 1539 720 1529 718 1529 716 1529 687 1539 630 1529 628 1529 626 1529 624 1529 609 1541 430 1541 432 1570"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="among the Reindeer Chukchee the most important game hunted. With the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l20" HPOS="432" VPOS="1588" WIDTH="1765" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="432 1629 2197 1629" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1629 432 1643 1431 1643 1447 1652 1449 1652 1451 1652 1453 1652 2197 1641 2197 1629 2197 1599 2154 1588 2152 1588 2150 1588 2079 1599 1929 1588 1927 1588 1835 1598 1797 1588 1795 1588 1794 1588 1792 1588 1790 1588 1772 1601 1607 1601 1588 1588 1586 1588 1584 1588 1582 1588 1511 1601 1325 1601 1288 1588 1286 1588 1284 1588 1137 1601 979 1601 942 1588 940 1588 938 1588 936 1588 902 1599 814 1588 812 1588 810 1588 785 1598 765 1588 763 1588 761 1588 759 1588 726 1598 675 1588 673 1588 671 1588 669 1588 654 1599 564 1588 562 1588 432 1592 432 1629"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Reindeer Chukchee the ceremonial has a special name, ênatčɪˊɪrg̣ɪn. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l21" HPOS="430" VPOS="1643" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="432 1692 2197 1684" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1692 432 1705 2195 1699 2197 1684 2195 1656 2166 1643 2164 1643 2162 1643 2160 1643 2109 1654 2040 1643 2038 1643 1976 1654 1946 1643 1944 1643 1942 1643 1886 1654 1854 1643 1852 1643 1850 1643 1848 1643 1803 1654 1764 1643 1762 1643 1760 1643 1758 1643 1756 1643 1735 1658 1676 1658 1656 1645 1654 1645 1652 1645 1651 1645 1598 1656 1553 1645 1551 1645 1549 1645 1468 1658 1339 1658 1322 1645 1320 1645 1318 1645 1316 1645 1241 1660 1065 1660 1028 1646 1026 1646 1024 1646 850 1660 814 1648 812 1648 810 1648 808 1648 783 1658 763 1648 761 1648 673 1648 671 1648 669 1648 667 1648 652 1660 573 1648 571 1648 430 1654 432 1692"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Maritime Chukchee call the ceremonial connected with walrus-hunting by this"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l22" HPOS="432" VPOS="1709" WIDTH="1763" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="432 1750 2195 1750" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1750 432 1764 2193 1770 2195 1750 2195 1721 1842 1709 1841 1709 1839 1709 1817 1721 1625 1721 1572 1709 1570 1709 1568 1709 1535 1719 1478 1709 1476 1709 1408 1719 1376 1709 1374 1709 1372 1709 1370 1709 1341 1719 1310 1709 1308 1709 1306 1709 1210 1719 1177 1709 1175 1709 1173 1709 1171 1709 1132 1719 1043 1709 1041 1709 991 1719 910 1709 908 1709 906 1709 904 1709 891 1719 826 1709 824 1709 779 1719 740 1709 738 1709 736 1709 734 1709 705 1719 677 1709 675 1709 673 1709 432 1719 432 1750"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="name; and the Maritime Koryak apply it, with the proper phonetic change,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l23" HPOS="430" VPOS="1770" WIDTH="733" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="430 1807 1163 1807" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1807 430 1823 1163 1823 1163 1807 1163 1780 1122 1770 1120 1770 1118 1770 969 1780 940 1770 938 1770 936 1770 934 1770 932 1770 918 1780 891 1770 889 1770 887 1770 885 1770 844 1780 779 1770 777 1770 554 1780 524 1770 522 1770 520 1770 430 1780 430 1807"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="to the ceremonial of the whale."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l24" HPOS="538" VPOS="1823" WIDTH="1659" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="540 1870 2197 1866" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="540 1870 540 1883 2195 1880 2197 1866 2193 1836 2119 1836 2093 1823 2091 1823 2089 1823 2019 1836 1807 1836 1790 1823 1788 1823 1786 1823 1784 1823 1782 1823 1758 1834 1743 1823 1741 1823 1739 1823 1737 1823 1735 1823 1701 1833 1652 1823 1651 1823 1649 1823 1647 1823 1631 1834 1551 1823 1549 1823 1470 1833 1433 1823 1431 1823 1429 1823 1427 1823 1425 1823 1410 1834 1357 1825 1355 1825 1353 1825 1351 1825 1333 1836 1302 1825 1300 1825 1298 1825 1239 1836 1204 1825 1202 1825 1200 1825 1130 1838 953 1838 920 1825 918 1825 916 1825 824 1836 779 1825 777 1825 775 1825 730 1834 689 1825 687 1825 685 1825 683 1825 654 1836 595 1825 593 1825 538 1833 540 1870"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The details of the ceremonial with the Reindeer Chukchee are as follows."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l25" HPOS="432" VPOS="1887" WIDTH="1763" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="432 1928 2195 1928" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1928 432 1942 2193 1948 2195 1928 2195 1899 2107 1887 2105 1887 2007 1897 1933 1887 1931 1887 1929 1887 1903 1897 1889 1887 1888 1887 1886 1887 1884 1887 1805 1897 1660 1887 1658 1887 1600 1897 1492 1887 1490 1887 1488 1887 1459 1897 1429 1887 1427 1887 1425 1887 1349 1897 1316 1887 1314 1887 1312 1887 1310 1887 1282 1897 1241 1887 1239 1887 1237 1887 1235 1887 1206 1897 432 1891 432 1928"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The first wild buck that comes to the herd is frequently met with incantations,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l26" HPOS="428" VPOS="1944" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="430 1989 2197 1981" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1989 430 2005 2195 1997 2197 1981 2193 1954 2056 1944 2054 1944 2052 1944 2050 1944 2036 1954 2013 1944 2011 1944 2009 1944 2007 1944 2005 1944 1989 1956 1805 1956 1778 1944 1776 1944 1774 1944 1772 1944 1747 1956 1664 1946 1662 1946 1660 1946 1658 1946 1643 1958 1537 1958 1506 1946 1504 1946 1502 1946 1500 1946 1498 1946 1482 1956 1210 1948 1208 1948 1206 1948 1180 1958 1133 1948 1132 1948 1130 1948 1108 1960 977 1960 871 1948 869 1948 724 1960 446 1950 444 1950 442 1950 440 1950 428 1956 430 1989"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the purpose of which is to make him assume for a while the ways of domes-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l27" HPOS="428" VPOS="2005" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="430 2050 2197 2044" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 2050 430 2064 1605 2069 1607 2069 1692 2060 2195 2060 2197 2044 2193 2015 1637 2005 1635 2005 1633 2005 1590 2019 1077 2019 1026 2007 1024 2007 1022 2007 1020 2007 1004 2019 947 2009 945 2009 944 2009 910 2019 652 2009 650 2009 603 2019 589 2009 587 2009 585 2009 446 2009 444 2009 442 2009 440 2009 428 2015 430 2050"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ticated reindeer, so that he may serve as a successful breeder. The details"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l28" HPOS="428" VPOS="2066" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="430 2109 2197 2103" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 2109 430 2124 2195 2120 2197 2103 2193 2073 1604 2066 1602 2066 1600 2066 1598 2066 1586 2075 1063 2068 1061 2068 1004 2079 428 2079 430 2109"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of the incantations will be described later in a special chapter. After a week"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-107_l29" HPOS="428" VPOS="2128" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="430 2169 2197 2165" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 2169 430 2183 2195 2179 2197 2165 2193 2138 1406 2128 1404 2128 1265 2138 628 2130 626 2130 428 2140 430 2169"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="or ten days, when the incantations have lost their power, the owner of the"/>
                    </TextLine>

